  "quests": {
    "_comment": "Per master, in order. type: bring (items taken), show (items checked), kill (creature, count, optional status: burning / slowed), shrines (all listed lit by you), quench (hold a weapon of an element in water), sneak (within 5 m of a sleeping kind, then 30 m off while it sleeps), tame (creature). pays: xp to the master's path, items, recipes learned. The last four of each master's line are The Unlearning (arc: unlearning; its last step pays the Heron's draught: a respec, cooks/build-endgame.md 2.2). title_reward: a title the step gives.",
